@date 2026-11-09

kpi Peak load | 4200 msg/s
kpi Consuming services | 6
kpi Replay window | 7 days
kpi Ordering | per account

We need ordering per customer account and replay of the last 7 days for audits. Three options: Managed Kafka, SQS with SNS, and a self-run RabbitMQ cluster.

## Comparison

cards

### Managed Kafka
- Ordering: yes, through partition keys
- Replay of 7 days: built in
- Operations effort: 12 hours a month

### SQS with SNS
- Ordering: yes, through FIFO queues, but each queue is capped near 3000 messages per second so we would need two
- Replay of 7 days: not available, we would have to archive to storage ourselves
- Operations effort: 3 hours a month

### Self-run RabbitMQ
- Ordering: yes, through queue sharding that we would build ourselves
- Replay of 7 days: possible only with the streams plugin, which the team has not used
- Operations effort: 30 hours a month

