## Risks

!! Only 2 of our 9 engineers have run Kafka before, so we budget 5 days of training.

- SQS has no replay, so audits would depend on an archive we build and run ourselves.
- RabbitMQ replay depends on a plugin the team has not used, and 30 hours a month of operations.

kpi Engineers who have run Kafka | 2 of 9 | 5 days of training budgeted | neutral

## Recommendation

! We recommend **Managed Kafka**, even though it costs $3,750 a month more than SQS, because replay of the last 7 days is an audit requirement.

step Decide on Managed Kafka | 2026-11-09
step Budget 5 days of Kafka training | 5 days
